---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GlassButton from '../components/GlassButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Intuitive Tarot Consultations — Astro by Anisha"
  description="Contemplative, psychological tarot readings by Anisha Banerji. Archetypal clarity, crossroad navigation, and empowered decision-making without fatalism or melodrama."
  currentPath="/tarot"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-12 pb-10 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-14 md:pt-20 md:pb-16 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20 bg-[#fcfbf9] border-b border-[#28231e]/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl xl:max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 text-[#a37a4c] mb-4">
        <span>Contemplative Archetypes</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#1c1917] tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Intuitive Tarot
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-[#57534e] font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed italic">
        "The cards do not predict what is guaranteed; they illuminate the subconscious currents guiding your next conscious choice."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrative Section -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 lg:py-24 xl:py-28 bg-[#faf8f5]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl xl:max-w-6xl 2xl:max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
        
        <div class="md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-6 space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base text-[#57534e] font-light leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1c1917] leading-tight">
            A Psychological Mirror, Not Fortune-Telling
          </h2>
          <p>
            In my practice, the tarot is held as an exquisite archetypal library. Rooted in Jungian psychology and intuitive discernment, each of the 78 keys reflects a specific threshold of human development, grief, mastery, or transformation.
          </p>
          <p>
            When we lay the cards during a session, we are not trying to spy on a locked future. We are pausing the noise of everyday life to take an honest, compassionate inventory of what is happening beneath the surface of your conscious thoughts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-6">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-lg bg-white aspect-[4/3] max-w-md md:max-w-none mx-auto">
            <img
              src="/images/studio.jpg"
              alt="Anisha's tarot consultation table"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Spread Formats -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#1c1917]">
          Consultation Formats
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#57534e] font-light mt-2">
          Tailored structures designed to resolve specific crossroads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 md:p-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a37a4c] font-semibold block mb-2">Crossroad Analysis</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#1c1917] mb-3">The Two Paths</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#57534e] font-light leading-relaxed">
              When facing a pivotal decision between two offers, partnerships, or creative trajectories, this spread explores the energetic consequences and inner alignment of each path.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/5 text-xs text-[#857f77]">
            Ideal for Career & Relocation Shifts
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a37a4c] font-semibold block mb-2">Relational Dynamic</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#1c1917] mb-3">The Dyad Mirror</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#57534e] font-light leading-relaxed">
              Unpacking the unspoken contracts, energetic projections, and genuine opportunities for growth within an intimate or business partnership.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/5 text-xs text-[#857f77]">
            Ideal for Partnerships & Healing
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-lg bg-white border border-[#28231e]/10 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#a37a4c] font-semibold block mb-2">Seasonal Overview</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#1c1917] mb-3">The Solar Return / Year Ahead</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#57534e] font-light leading-relaxed">
              A comprehensive 12-month archetypal forecast mapping the dominant lessons, gifts, and fallow seasons for your upcoming year of life.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#28231e]/5 text-xs text-[#857f77]">
            Ideal for Birthdays & New Years
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 text-center">
        <GlassButton
          text="Book a Consultation"
          href="/consultations"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
